==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology 1===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{recons|do|lang=sla-pro}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{recons|de-|lang=ine-pro}}, {{recons|do-|lang=ine-pro}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{audio|Sr-Do.ogg|audio}}
* {{IPA|/dô/|lang=sh}}

====Adverb====
{{sh-adverb|head=до̏|c|do|dȍ}}

# [[only]], [[except]]
#: {{usex|ни(т)ко до ја|t=nobody but me, only me|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|не једе ништа до комад хљеба/хлеба|t=he eats nothing except a piece of bread|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# [[around]], [[approximately]]
#: {{usex|до два метра|t=around two meters|lang=sh|inline=1}} 
#: {{usex|око 5 кила|t=around five kilograms|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# [[due to]], [[because]] of
#: {{usex|то је до хране|t=that's due to the food|lang=sh|inline=1}}

====Preposition====
{{sh-preposition|head=до̏|c|do|dȍ}}

# {{context|with genitive|lang=sh}} [[up to]], [[to]], [[as far as]], [[by]]
#: {{usex|од Загреба до Београда|t=from Zagreb to Belgrade|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|од јутра до мрака|t=from morning to night|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|од 5 до 10 сати|t=from 5 to 10 o'clock|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|од врха до дна|t=from top to bottom|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|до р(иј)еке|t=as far as the river|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|сад је пет до седам|t=now it's five minutes to seven|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|до понед(ј)ељка|t=by Monday|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|до сада|t=so far, thus far, till now|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|до недавна|t=until recently|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|до дана данашњега|t=to this very day|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|све до|t=as far as up to, all the way to|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|до куда|t=how far|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|до туда|t=thus far, up to here|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# [[before]] (= {{term|sc=Cyrl|прије|при̏је|lang=sh}}/{{term|sc=Cyrl|пре|пре̏|lang=sh}})
#: {{usex|до рата|t=before the war|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# [[beside]], [[next]] (to){{attention|sh|by which case is this sense accompanied?}}
#: {{usex|с(ј)еди до мене|t=sit next to me|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|један до другога|t=side by side|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# {{non gloss definition|idiomatic and figurative meanings}}
#: {{usex|није ми до тога|t=I don't feel like doing that|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|није ми до см(иј)еха|t=I don't feel like laughing|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|њему је само до секса|t=he is only interested in sex|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|није ми пуно стало до тога|t=I'm not very much interested in that|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|није до мене|t=it's not up to me, it's no me to lame|lang=sh|inline=1}}

